Description: Speaker equalization LADSPA plugin
 A flexible speaker equalization solution for Linux audio.
 Provides LADSPA plugin for audio processing.
 .
 Features:
  - 2x2 stereo processing with crossbar routing
  - 20-band parametric EQ per channel (input and output)
  - Per-band enable/disable functionality
  - Delay compensation
